      "optionIndex": 0,
      "isCorrect": true,
      "reason": "原波速 4×1.2＝4.8 m/s；新 λ＝4.8/8＝0.60 m。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 1,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "頻率加倍時波長應減半，不是加倍。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 2,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "波速不變不代表波長不變。"
